SUMMARY:Performance / Entanglement: Steffani Jemison and Leslie Cuyjet on 
 Maren Hassinger and Senga Nengudi — Berkeley/San Francisco
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-07:00":20261031T130000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-07:00":20261031T140000
DTSTAMP:20261031T123911Z
UID:0375aa4f7dfa3d71822db37d45fd@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Performing Arts\,Berkeley/San Francisco\,United
  States
DESCRIPTION:Artist Steffani Jemison and choreographer Leslie Cuyjet perfor
 m a collaborative piece that reflects on the dynamic artistic relationship
  between Maren Hassinger and Senga Nengudi. Performing alongside projectio
 ns of archival images depicting Hassinger and Nengudi’s collaborations\,
  Jemison and Cuyjet improvise together with text\, dance\, and thread. The
  performance meditates on the intense intimacy and attunement involved in 
 longstanding artistic collaborations like Hassinger and Nengudi’s\, payi
 ng homage to the powerful intergenerational legacy of their collective wor
 ks.\nCategory: Performing Arts\nOriginal listing: https://events.berkeley.
 edu/BAMPFA/event/336514-performance-entanglement-steffani-jemison-and
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, BAMPFA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
