 ng a network of collaborations that has continued to grow since the projec
 t’s beginnings. For Kinesis\, vol. 10\, Galan Trio returns to the San Fr
 ancisco Bay Area for the second time before continuing north to Oregon and
  Washington\, expanding the project into the Pacific Northwest for the fir
 st time. The program features music by Bonnie Miksch\, Ryan M. Howard\, Br
 uce Hamilton\, Ryan Francis\, Michael Johanson\, Cindy Cox\, and Inés Thi
